HTML Elements
-------------
    Standard Elements that browser recognize

    ** Paragraph **
    <p>content</p>

    ** Heading **
    <h1> heading </h>


    these components used to design the structure of websites called HTML tags.

HTML tags
---------
    A container for some content or other tags.
    <p> This is a paragraph </p>
    <p></p> : Elements 
    this is a paragraph : content
    <p> : opening tags
    </p> closing tag